*> k-nearest-neighbors classification of iris species from petal measurements, with
*> leave-one-out evaluation and decision-region plots for k = 5, 1 and 25.
*> CMD: just TARGET=knn_iris_ex run-cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. KNN-IRIS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

78 FORMULA VALUE "Species ~ Petal.Length + Petal.Width".

01 IRIS          USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MODEL         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 K-MODEL       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FRAME         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FITTED        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT          USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT-PATH     PIC X(64).
01 NROWS         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 ROW           USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MISCLASSIFIED USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 ACTUAL        PIC X(32).
01 PETAL-LENGTH  USAGE COMP-2.
01 PETAL-WIDTH   USAGE COMP-2.
01 PERCENT       USAGE COMP-2.
01 NUM-EDIT      PIC Z(8)9.
01 NUM-EDIT-2    PIC Z(8)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_iris" USING DM-DATA-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NROWS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_ncols" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE NROWS TO NUM-EDIT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-RESULT TO NUM-EDIT-2
    DISPLAY "iris: " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) " rows x " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-2) " cols"
    DISPLAY " "

    MOVE IRIS TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-DATA
    MOVE FORMULA TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_new" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_print_summary" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Confusion matrix (leave-one-out; rows = actual, cols = predicted):"
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX-SELF
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_confusion_matrix" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX-RESULT TO FRAME
    PERFORM DISPLAY-FRAME

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Leave-one-out misclassified rows:"
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-SELF
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-NEWDATA
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_predict" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-RESULT TO FITTED
    *> Copy the predicted labels into DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(1..150).
    MOVE FITTED TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-START
    CALL "dm_vector_string_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE 0 TO MISCLASSIFIED
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
        MOVE "Species" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX
        CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) TO ACTUAL
        IF DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(ROW + 1) NOT = ACTUAL
            ADD 1 TO MISCLASSIFIED
            MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-LENGTH
            MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-WIDTH
            MOVE ROW TO NUM-EDIT
            DISPLAY "  row " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) ": Petal.Length=" PETAL-LENGTH
                " Petal.Width=" PETAL-WIDTH "  actual=" FUNCTION TRIM(ACTUAL)
                "  predicted=" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(ROW + 1))
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    COMPUTE PERCENT = 100.0 * MISCLASSIFIED / NROWS
    MOVE MISCLASSIFIED TO NUM-EDIT
    MOVE NROWS TO NUM-EDIT-2
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) " of " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-2) " misclassified ("
        PERCENT "%)"
    MOVE FITTED TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    MOVE MODEL TO K-MODEL
    MOVE "knn_iris_decision_regions_k5.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-DECISION-REGIONS
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Saved knn_iris_decision_regions_k5.svg"

    *> k=1 memorizes every training point (a jagged, overfit boundary with an island
    *> around every point, noise included); k=25 averages over a much larger
    *> neighborhood (a very smooth, underfit boundary). Arguments: data, formula, k, ...
    MOVE 3 TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE 1 TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-K
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_new" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO K-MODEL
    PERFORM ACCURACY-PERCENT
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "k=1  leave-one-out accuracy: " PERCENT "%"
    MOVE "knn_iris_decision_regions_k1.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-DECISION-REGIONS
    DISPLAY "Saved knn_iris_decision_regions_k1.svg"
    MOVE K-MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    MOVE 25 TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-K
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_new" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO K-MODEL
    PERFORM ACCURACY-PERCENT
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "k=25 leave-one-out accuracy: " PERCENT "%"
    MOVE "knn_iris_decision_regions_k25.svg" TO PLOT-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-DECISION-REGIONS
    DISPLAY "Saved knn_iris_decision_regions_k25.svg"
    MOVE K-MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    MOVE MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> PERCENT gets K-MODEL's leave-one-out accuracy as a percentage.
ACCURACY-PERCENT.
    MOVE K-MODEL TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-SELF
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_training_accuracy" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    COMPUTE PERCENT = DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-RESULT * 100.0.

*> Saves K-MODEL's decision regions over the petal measurements to PLOT-PATH.
SAVE-DECISION-REGIONS.
    MOVE K-MODEL TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-SELF
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-X-FEATURE
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-Y-FEATURE
    CALL "dm_knn_classifier_plot_decision_regions" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SELF
    MOVE PLOT-PATH TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    CALL "dm_plot_save" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Reads iris column DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME at ROW.
NUMERIC-AT.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-SELF
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> Displays the DataFrame FRAME and closes it.
DISPLAY-FRAME.
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_to_string" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT-LENGTH)
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
